flowchart TD
    A[Manager/Admin opens user list] --> B[Search by name/email, role, status]
    B --> C{Current role}
    C -->|Admin| D[Search all matching users]
    C -->|Manager| E[Exclude Admin and Manager accounts]
    D --> F[Show paginated results]
    E --> F
    F --> G[Open user detail]
    G --> H{Target allowed for current role?}
    H -->|No| I[Return 403]
    H -->|Yes| J{Requested action}
    J -->|Block| K{Self or not ACTIVE?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Reject action]
    K -->|No| M[Validate reason]
    M --> N[Set BLOCKED and save reason]
    J -->|Unblock| O{Self or not BLOCKED?}
    O -->|Yes| L
    O -->|No| P[Set ACTIVE and clear lock fields]
    N --> Q[Redirect with result]
    P --> Q
